"\n"
"The Organizer workspace lists the tasks of each area, with their due dates:\n"
"{lienEspace}\n"
"\n"
"Please review the tasks in your area and point out anything that is missing.\n"
"\n"
"[Add the date of the first meeting or the next steps here.]\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your commitment.\n"
"\n"
"{signature}"

#: src/lib/messages.ts
msgid "{salutation}\n"
"\n"
"Nous arrivons au terme de {periode}. Nous vous remercions pour le temps et l’énergie que vous y avez consacrés.\n"
"\n"
"[Ajoutez ici un bilan en quelques lignes : participation, points forts, suites prévues.]\n"
"\n"
"Vos remarques nous aideront à préparer la suite. Vous pouvez les noter dans les fiches de votre périmètre ou nous répondre par mail.\n"
"\n"
"{signature}"
msgstr "{salutation}\n"
"\n"
"{periode} is coming to an end. Thank you for the time and energy you have given to it.\n"
"\n"
"[Add a short summary here: participation, highlights, next steps.]\n"
"\n"
"Your feedback will help us prepare for what comes next. You can note it in the sheets of your area or reply to us by email.\n"
"\n"
"{signature}"

#: src/lib/messages.ts
